111:/*
112:DESCRIPTION
113:This PAL converts the CPUs bus enable lines to address lines and cycles from 
114:one to the next when multiple cycles are required. It also determines_when 
115:the last cycle is in progress to develop the Cycle LAST signal. 
116:Rev A of this device changes the CX16* equation to go away on ALE. The input 
117:T01 is changed to T10 and IO16* is changed to LM_IO as part of an overall 
118:change to delay the sampling of IO16* by one clock. Rev A can be used in any 
119:D4-PROCESSOR from rev X5 up.
120:Rev D is for the D4-Processor Enhanced (397 version)
121:-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
122:
123:*/
124:
125:

